{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "HummingDeck API",
    "version": "1.12.0",
    "description": "The HummingDeck API. Provides document search, upload and replacement, room creation and structure (tabs, documents, links, embeds, sections), room archive and restore, document and room share link management, company/contact find-or-create operations, view and decision events, and webhooks for the Zapier integration.\n\nTwo credential types are accepted, and they are not interchangeable:\n\n**Workspace API key** (`Authorization: Bearer hd_api_...`): issued by a workspace owner or admin in Workspace settings, Integrations, HummingDeck API. REST API access is available by request on Business and is enabled per workspace after review. A workspace can have multiple named keys, each with an explicit set of scopes and independent revocation. Each write scope includes the matching read scope; read scopes do not grant write access. The raw key is shown once at creation and is not retrievable afterwards; it expires one year after creation. Every key is bound permanently to its workspace, so a request cannot select or override its workspace. Webhook subscription endpoints are not available to this credential.\n\n**Zapier OAuth** (`Authorization: Bearer {access_token}`): issued through the OAuth authorization flow when a workspace connects the Zapier integration. Access tokens expire after 30 days; the 90-day refresh token obtains a new one. This is the only credential that can create or delete webhook subscriptions.\n\nEach operation documents its primary always-required workspace-key capability in `x-required-api-key-scope`. Additional always-required capabilities appear in `x-additional-required-api-key-scopes`; body-dependent capabilities appear in `x-conditional-api-key-scopes`, keyed by scope with the exact trigger as its value. `GET /me` requires no scope. A valid key that lacks a required capability receives `403 INSUFFICIENT_SCOPE`; the response names `requiredScope`.\n\nManual keys and Zapier OAuth connections are limited per credential to 600 reads per 5 minutes, 120 writes per minute, 60 room-view reads per minute, and 20 uploads per hour. Shared workspace ceilings are twice those values across all credentials. Failed bearer authentication and invalid OAuth client authentication are each limited per trusted client IP to 60 attempts per 5 minutes. Requests may receive `429 RATE_LIMITED`; use the delta seconds in `Retry-After` before retrying. Rooms API JSON bodies are limited to 262,144 bytes; company, contact, share, and webhook JSON bodies are limited to 32,768 bytes; and document-upload and replacement multipart requests are limited to 32,505,856 bytes, including at most a 30 MiB file. Oversized bodies return `413 PAYLOAD_TOO_LARGE` before structured parsing.\n\nA request is rejected with 401 when the token is unknown or malformed, has expired, has been switched off, belongs to a workspace whose API access was turned off, or was issued by someone who is no longer an owner or admin of that workspace.",
    "contact": {
      "name": "HummingDeck Support",
      "url": "https://hummingdeck.com",
      "email": "support@hummingdeck.com"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://app.hummingdeck.com/api/v1",
      "description": "Production"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "apiToken": []
    },
    {
      "oauth2": []
    }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "apiToken": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "hd_api_...",
        "description": "Named workspace API key issued by a workspace owner or admin. Prefixed hd_api_, shown once at creation, valid for one year, independently scoped and revoked, and bound permanently to its workspace. Each *:write scope includes the matching *:read capability. Not accepted on webhook subscription endpoints."
      },
      "oauth2": {
        "type": "oauth2",
        "description": "Issued by the Zapier integration's OAuth flow. Access tokens last 30 days; refresh tokens last 90 days. The only credential accepted on webhook subscription endpoints.",
        "flows": {
          "authorizationCode": {
            "authorizationUrl": "https://app.hummingdeck.com/api/zapier/authorize",
            "tokenUrl": "https://app.hummingdeck.com/api/zapier/token",
            "scopes": {}
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "RateLimited": {
        "description": "Rate limit exceeded. Retry after the number of seconds in Retry-After.",
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            },
            "description": "Seconds until the current fixed window resets."
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "PayloadTooLarge": {
        "description": "Request body exceeds the byte ceiling documented for this operation.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "InsufficientScope": {
        "description": "The authenticated workspace API key lacks a scope required by this operation (INSUFFICIENT_SCOPE).",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "InternalServerError": {
        "description": "The request failed unexpectedly. The response is deliberately bounded and never includes internal error details.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "error": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "Internal server error"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "error"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "DocumentView": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "viewId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique identifier for this view session",
            "example": "a1b2c3d4-5678-90ab-cdef-1234567890ab"
          },
          "shareSlug": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Slug of the share link that was viewed",
            "example": "kry377wf7gb7i2pt"
          },
          "viewerEmail": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Email of the viewer (from personal link or email gate). Empty string if unknown.",
            "example": "john@company.com"
          },
          "viewerName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Name of the viewer (from personal link). Empty string if unknown.",
            "example": "John Smith"
          },
          "companyName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Company name associated with the share link. Empty string if unknown.",
            "example": "Acme Inc."
          },
          "deckTitle": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Title of the document that was viewed",
            "example": "Q3 Sales Proposal"
          },
          "device": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Device type of the viewer. \"-\" when the device was not recorded.",
            "enum": [
              "desktop",
              "mobile",
              "tablet",
              "-"
            ],
            "example": "desktop"
          },
          "location": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Geographic location of the viewer (city, country)",
            "example": "San Francisco, United States"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "Timestamp when the view occurred (ISO 8601)",
            "example": "2026-03-27T14:30:00.000Z"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "viewId",
          "shareSlug",
          "viewerEmail",
          "viewerName",
          "companyName",
          "deckTitle",
          "device",
          "location",
          "createdAt"
        ]
      },
      "ShareLink": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unique identifier for the share link"
          },
          "slug": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "URL slug for the share link"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "personal",
              "anonymous"
            ],
            "description": "Link type"
          },
          "recipientName": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Recipient name, for personal links"
          },
          "recipientEmail": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Recipient email, for personal links"
          },
          "contact": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Contact"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Contact attached to the link, when personal account resolution was requested"
          },
          "contactCreated": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "True when this request created the returned contact"
          },
          "company": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Company"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Company attached to the link, when resolved"
          },
          "companyCreated": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "True when this request created the returned company"
          },
          "shareUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "Full trackable URL to view the shared document, using the workspace's eligible active custom domain when configured",
            "example": "https://hummingdeck.com/view/kry377wf7gb7i2pt"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "slug",
          "type",
          "contactCreated",
          "companyCreated",
          "shareUrl",
          "createdAt"
        ]
      },
      "RoomItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "tabId": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "The tab the item appears in. Items stored without a tab appear in the first content tab and report that tab."
          },
          "position": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "0-based place within its tab."
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "document",
              "url",
              "embed",
              "section"
            ]
          },
          "title": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "documentId": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "processingStatus": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              "pending",
              "processing",
              "completed",
              "failed",
              null
            ],
            "description": "Documents only; null for other items. A document can be added while it is still processing; send the room link once it reads completed."
          },
          "processingErrorCode": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Why processing failed, when processingStatus is failed."
          },
          "deliveryMode": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "enum": [
              "preview",
              "download_only",
              null
            ],
            "description": "Documents only; null for other items. download_only files are never previewed: recipients download them and open them on their device, and their downloads stay on for every link."
          },
          "urlId": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "url": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "embedUrl": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uri"
          },
          "allowDownloads": {
            "type": [
              "boolean",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "tabId",
          "position",
          "type",
          "title",
          "documentId",
          "processingStatus",
          "processingErrorCode",
          "deliveryMode",
          "urlId",
          "url",
          "embedUrl",
          "allowDownloads",
          "createdAt"
        ]
      },
      "Room": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "labels": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoomLabelRef"
            }
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "active",
              "archived"
            ]
          },
          "welcomeMessage": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "allowDownloads": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "viewerLayoutMode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "viewer-choice",
              "list",
              "grid"
            ]
          },
          "viewerThemeMode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "light",
              "system",
              "viewer-choice"
            ]
          },
          "sender": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ]
              },
              "title": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ]
              },
              "email": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ],
                "format": "email"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name",
              "title",
              "email"
            ]
          },
          "company": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoomCompanyReference"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Returned only when the API key has crm:read; otherwise null."
          },
          "contact": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoomContactReference"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Returned only when the API key has crm:read; otherwise null."
          },
          "tabs": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "In the room's tab order.",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoomTab"
            }
          },
          "items": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoomItem"
            },
            "description": "Tab by tab, in tab order, then in order within each tab."
          },
          "links": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "active": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0
              },
              "total": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "active",
              "total"
            ]
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "name",
          "status",
          "welcomeMessage",
          "allowDownloads",
          "viewerLayoutMode",
          "viewerThemeMode",
          "sender",
          "company",
          "contact",
          "tabs",
          "items",
          "links",
          "createdAt",
          "updatedAt",
          "labels"
        ]
      },
      "TaskAssignee": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Who owns a task. A side on its own means the party itself owns it, which is the usual case for work on the recipient's side.",
        "required": [
          "side"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "side": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "seller",
              "buyer"
            ],
            "description": "seller is the workspace, buyer is the recipient. Internal wording; neither word appears in the product."
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "email",
            "description": "Omit to let the party itself own the task. On the workspace side an address matching a member is stored as that member."
          },
          "displayName": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Requires email."
          }
        }
      },
      "ActionPlanSettings": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "showDueDates": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "notificationsEnabled": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "recipientCompletionEnabled": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Whether people who open the room may mark their own side's tasks complete."
          },
          "targetDate": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "title",
          "showDueDates",
          "notificationsEnabled",
          "recipientCompletionEnabled",
          "targetDate",
          "updatedAt"
        ]
      },
      "ActionPlanPhase": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "position": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "color": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "pattern": "^#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}$",
            "description": "Any brand colour. null is neutral, which is the default."
          },
          "targetDate": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date"
          },
          "relativeDayOffset": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Days from plan.targetDate used to derive targetDate."
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "title",
          "position",
          "color",
          "targetDate",
          "relativeDayOffset",
          "createdAt",
          "updatedAt"
        ]
      },
      "ActionPlanTask": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "phaseId": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "parentTaskId": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Markdown."
          },
          "assignee": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "allOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TaskAssignee"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "dueDate": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date"
          },
          "relativeDayOffset": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Days from plan.targetDate used to derive dueDate."
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "todo",
              "done"
            ]
          },
          "visibility": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "buyer_visible",
              "internal"
            ],
            "description": "buyer_visible is shown in the room; internal is workspace only."
          },
          "position": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "completedAt": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "phaseId",
          "parentTaskId",
          "title",
          "description",
          "assignee",
          "dueDate",
          "relativeDayOffset",
          "status",
          "visibility",
          "position",
          "completedAt",
          "createdAt",
          "updatedAt"
        ]
      },
      "ActionPlanProgressCount": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "completed": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "total": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "percent": {
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "completed",
          "total",
          "percent"
        ]
      },
      "ActionPlan": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "plan": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActionPlanSettings"
          },
          "phases": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActionPlanPhase"
            }
          },
          "tasks": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActionPlanTask"
            }
          },
          "dependencies": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "taskId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uuid"
                },
                "dependsOnTaskId": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "format": "uuid"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "taskId",
                "dependsOnTaskId"
              ]
            }
          },
          "progress": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "visible counts the tasks the room shows; all includes internal ones.",
            "properties": {
              "visible": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActionPlanProgressCount"
              },
              "all": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActionPlanProgressCount"
              },
              "byPhase": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "visible": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActionPlanProgressCount"
                    },
                    "all": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActionPlanProgressCount"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "visible",
                    "all"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "visible",
              "all",
              "byPhase"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "plan",
          "phases",
          "tasks",
          "dependencies",
          "progress"
        ]
      },
      "UpdateActionPlanRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "At least one field.",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 255
          },
          "showDueDates": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "notificationsEnabled": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "recipientCompletionEnabled": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "targetDate": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date"
          }
        },
        "minProperties": 1
      },
      "CreatePhaseRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "title"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 255
          },
          "targetDate": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Use targetDate or relativeDayOffset, not both when both values are non-null."
          },
          "relativeDayOffset": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "minimum": -3650,
            "maximum": 3650,
            "description": "Days from plan.targetDate. On create, targetDate is materialized from the locked plan target; it remains null when the plan has no target date until a later plan-target reflow."
          },
          "color": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "pattern": "^#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}$"
          },
          "position": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "minimum": 0
          }
        },
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "targetDate",
            "relativeDayOffset"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "targetDate": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "relativeDayOffset": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "UpdatePhaseRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "At least one field.",
        "properties": {
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 255
          },
          "targetDate": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date",
            "description": "Use targetDate or relativeDayOffset, not both when both values are non-null."
          },
          "relativeDayOffset": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "minimum": -3650,
            "maximum": 3650,
            "description": "Days from plan.targetDate. On create, targetDate is materialized from the locked plan target; it remains null when the plan has no target date until a later plan-target reflow."
          },
          "color": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "pattern": "^#[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}$"
          },
          "position": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "minimum": 0
          }
        },
        "minProperties": 1,
        "not": {
          "required": [
            "targetDate",
            "relativeDayOffset"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "targetDate": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "relativeDayOffset": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        }
      },
