        "description": "Requires a workspace API token; Zapier OAuth credentials are rejected. Returns the workspace's rooms, newest first, with document and link counts. Company and contact are included when the key has crm:read and are null otherwise. Filter with status, search (part of the room name, ignoring case), and companyId; the companyId filter requires crm:read. Pages hold up to limit rooms; pass a page's nextCursor as cursor to get the next page. nextCursor is null on the last page.",
